---
import { photos } from "../photos";
import Cta from "./Cta.astro";
import Photo from "./Photo.astro";
---
<section id="origin" class="strate container" aria-labelledby="origin-title">
  <div class="grid edito ruled">
    <div class="edito-text rv-up">
      <p class="mini">Chapter 01 · Origin</p>
      <h2 id="origin-title" class="title-page">A discovery in <em>Adjuntas.</em></h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="title-small">Three years ago, deep in the mountains of Puerto Rico, I walked the rows of Sandra Farms, a small estate in Adjuntas growing arabica at elevations most farms can only dream of. I bought a bag, took it home, and ground it fine the way my mom taught me.</p>
        <p>What came out of the cezve that morning changed everything. The body, the foam, the chocolate-and-citrus finish. Puerto Rican coffee, it turns out, was made for Turkish brewing.</p>
        <p>Turblend is what happened next: a Puerto Rican bean and a Turkish ritual, blended into one cup. A small, stubborn project that starts with pop-ups and is growing into a shop in Cincinnati.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="signature">
        <span class="signature-name">Muhammed F. Çetinkaya</span>
        <span class="signature-role mini">Founder</span>
      </p>
      <Cta class="cta-next" href="#method" label="Next: how it’s brewed" />
    </div>

    <!-- ORIGIN PHOTOS: the cherries are Unsplash stock (by eli hirtzel), not Sandra Farms;
         swap in one from the farm when we have it. The mountain view is our own.
         Small (portrait, 4:5), tall (portrait, 2:3). -->
    <div class="edito-small rv" data-d="1">
      <figure class="frame frame-45">
        <Photo src={photos.cherries} widths={[400, 800, 1200]} sizes="(min-width: 1760px) 370px, (min-width: 1024px) 21vw, 39vw" alt="Ripe red and yellow coffee cherries on the branch" />
      </figure>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt class="mini">Estate</dt><dd>Sandra Farms</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="mini">Region</dt><dd>Adjuntas, PR</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="mini">Elevation</dt><dd>3,200 ft</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <figure class="edito-big rv" data-d="2">
      <div class="frame frame-23">
        <Photo src={photos.origin} widths={[400, 800, 1200]} sizes="(min-width: 1690px) 510px, (min-width: 1024px) 30vw, 56vw" alt="Mist in a forested mountain valley under a wide cloudy sky, with palms and yellow flowers in front" />
      </div>
      <figcaption class="fig-note mini">18.2101° N · 66.8193° W<br>Adjuntas · Puerto Rico</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
